    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Ultrasonic gas meter consisting of a cylindrical spool piece with 4 horizontal paths. Multiple configurations can be combined in a single housing: 4 paths (single meter), 4+1 (4 pay and 1 check), 4+2 (4 pay and 2 check), 4+3 (4 pay and 3 check), 4+4 (either pay and check or 2 separate meters). In double meter configuration the pay and check meter shall have a different indicator with a clear distinction; both meters must have their own nameplate with unique serial number. A thermowell may be mounted at 2D-5D from the outlet of the meter. A transducer path pair and the electronics mainboard can be exchanged without deterioration of the metrological performance."
